  s7: Output drift
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: gate restores committed files (git checkout)
  s0 --> s3: gate deletes generated files (rm -f)
  s0 --> s2: gate sees dirty generated files [local WIP]
  s1 --> s4: gen:tokens exits with an error
  s1 --> s5: gen:tokens finishes without writing a file or gen:tokens reproduces committed output
  s1 --> s7: gen:tokens writes bytes that differ from HEAD
  s3 --> s4: gen:tokens exits with an error
  s3 --> s6: gen:tokens finishes without writing a file
  s3 --> s7: gen:tokens writes bytes that differ from HEAD
  s3 --> s5: gen:tokens reproduces committed output
